      Coverage axes:
        Per-instruction triggers (P2)..(P5), (P7):
          Rows E2-E8 + E15-E16 directly pin each trigger
          across alloc / share / throw / inheritance cases
        Architectural separation (P1):
          Row E13 is the dedicated pin — per-variable
          EffectClass = ALL on a call result does NOT poison
          the function's EffectSummary
        One-shot has_unbounded_stack (P6):
          Rows E9-E12 pin the SCC-based one-shot assignment
          across recursive / non-recursive / mutual-recursion
          / tail-call cases
        AND-fold semantics (P8):
          Rows E15-E16 pin the post-realization AND-fold
          across slow-path-only and clearing cases
        Multi-iteration soundness:
